{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2021-10-20 14:00:00', 'title': 'SOCALGAS LAUNCHES 2021 SOCAL CLIMATE CHAMPIONS GRANT PROGRAM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, OCT. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA GAS CO.\xa0(SOCALGAS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPLICATION WINDOW FOR ITS 2021 SOCAL CLIMATE CHAMPIONS GRANT PROGRAM IS NOW OPEN. THE PROGRAM PROVIDES GRANTS TO NON-PROFITS ORGANIZATIONS WORKING TO ADVANCING CLIMATE SOLUTIONS IN SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA.'}